{"title":"2023 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 14","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_1_by_OmegaLearn\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 1 by OmegaLearn</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Continuum_Math\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Continuum Math</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>For how many ordered pairs <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/e/8/8e8da0aef2d19017da7471378386d61620f288f5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a,b)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"41\" height=\"20\" /> of integers does the polynomial <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/4/5/24542cf03162bb16bfd3e60a46768d90573d0319.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^3+ax^2+bx+6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"141\" height=\"18\" /> have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> distinct integer roots?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/f/2/0f25a525629f8acfdd85a2fc4ee8224969714f57.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 5 \\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 6 \\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 8 \\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 7 \\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"351\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Denote three roots as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/9/c/39c36fed074ae1e659da16e38ad7192b18c10de4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r_1 &lt; r_2 &lt; r_3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"97\" height=\"15\" />.\nFollowing from Vieta's formula, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/1/c/31c5e9449e6f40de8b3d93ce6f36d164a433f695.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r_1r_2r_3 = -6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"96\" height=\"17\" />.\n</p><p>Case 1: All roots are negative.\n</p><p>We have the following solution: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/4/ff4477deebaf501e9bdbce27497b788fa671e7af.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\left( -3, -2, -1 \\right)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"102\" height=\"20\" />.\n</p><p>Case 2: One root is negative and two roots are positive.\n</p><p>We have the following solutions: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/3/c/73c12ac71618994e30f712f24c88d4a6699f47da.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\left( -3, 1, 2 \\right)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"74\" height=\"20\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/a/d/5ad64b303b9dc0da1d87cccffedefb47a7f65778.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\left( -2, 1, 3 \\right)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"74\" height=\"20\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/e/0/1e089a198db9a3517d194c08cbe8f06e0dbd615c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\left( -1, 2, 3 \\right)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"74\" height=\"20\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/8/968bd329b60f3efa56e8898baaa4ec83c6d887f5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\left( -1, 1, 6 \\right)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"74\" height=\"20\" />.\n</p><p>Putting all cases together, the total number of solutions is\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/3/3/5332123f1df16b710c12af65ecca0885f8cf2a34.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(A) 5}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"58\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p><p>~Steven Chen (Professor Chen Education Palace, www.professorchenedu.com)\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_1_by_OmegaLearn\">Video Solution 1 by OmegaLearn</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 1 by OmegaLearn\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/sgVkR0AOGhE\">https://youtu.be/sgVkR0AOGhE</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_Continuum_Math\">Video Solution by Continuum Math</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by Continuum Math\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/4g90YBQhAyk\">https://youtu.be/4g90YBQhAyk</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/IS6BDxGYTsE\">https://youtu.be/IS6BDxGYTsE</a>\n</p><p><br />\n~Steven Chen (Professor Chen Education Palace, www.professorchenedu.com)\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"2\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AMC_12B\" title=\"2023 AMC 12B\">2023 AMC 12B</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AMC_12B_Problems\" title=\"2023 AMC 12B Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AMC_12B_Answer_Key\" title=\"2023 AMC 12B Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AMC_12B_Problems/Prob